+```bash
+cd /tmp/audit-work/129-minPath-audit
+kprove spec-vacuity.k --definition verification-audit-kompiled --spec-module SPEC-VACUITY --claims SPEC-VACUITY.false-result-loop-tail --depth 110 --dry-run
